sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin<br/>(workstation)
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP or 443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reg as registry.redhat.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Pod as must-gather pod<br/>(gather.sh)
    participant FS as Pod-local<br/>must-gather/ dir

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Admin,FS: Flow 1 - OpenShift must-gather (default, COMPONENT=all)
    Admin->>API: oc adm must-gather --image=...odh-must-gather-rhel9<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS, Admin kubeconfig
    API-->>Pod: Create temp ns, SA, cluster-admin binding, pod
    Pod->>API: detect distro (infrastructures.config.openshift.io),<br/>Subscription / CSV lookup<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS DEFAULT:PQ, SA bearer token
    API-->>Pod: OCP, operator ns, RHOAI version
    Pod->>FS: write version file
    Pod->>API: oc adm inspect core namespaces + platform CRs<br/>(DSCI, DSC, components, services, webhooks, VAPs)
    API-->>Pod: YAML (Secret data elided by oc adm inspect)
    par 15 component collectors in parallel
        Pod->>API: list namespaces holding CR kinds, then oc adm inspect each
    and LLM-D / dependency collectors
        Pod->>API: kubectl_inspect (all api-resources incl. secrets)<br/>cert-manager, istio-system, LWS, monitoring, batch-gateway
        Pod->>API: dump all cluster-scoped types + nodes
    and Helm
        Pod->>API: helm get values / manifest (release Secrets)
    end
    API-->>Pod: CR YAML, pod logs, unredacted Secrets, Helm values
    Pod->>FS: write collected data, print summary
    Admin->>API: copy container rsync/exec, 6443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    API-->>Admin: must-gather.local.* bundle
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over Admin,FS: Flow 2 - xKS Job-based gather (CKS / AKS / EKS)
    Admin->>API: kubectl apply Job (SA must-gather-sa, pull secret)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS, Admin kubeconfig
    API-->>Reg: Kubelet pulls image<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS, redhat-pull-secret
    Reg-->>Pod: odh-must-gather-rhel9 image
    Pod->>API: api-resources discovery, get -o yaml, logs, Helm Secrets<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS, SA bearer token (*/* get,list,watch)
    API-->>Pod: Resources incl. Secrets in inspected namespaces
    Pod->>FS: write collected data, then sleep 600
    Admin->>API: kubectl cp (within 600s window)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS exec via API
    API-->>Admin: must-gather/ bundle
    end
